# A recipe's steps, checked (tools/make_manual.py --renders; nothing to see or hear: the expects are the point): from P10, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time about 2 s.
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 27
press SEL
tapkey w15
release SEL
tapkey w1
tap PLAY
wait 2500
press SEL
tapkey w8
release SEL
expect bank 0
wait 1500
turn K4 25 60
tap FX
turn K3 15 60
wait 1500
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn K4 -40 40
wait 2500
tapkey w0
wait 4000
